Impact Analysis: Changing Requirements
We modeled the impact of requirements changing twice as fast halfway through.
Estimated Cost- for the first 5 configurations under new conditions:
  Config 1: 0.2788
  Config 2: 0.1184
  Config 3: 0.1107
  Config 4: 0.2324
  Config 5: 0.2719

Note: The model was biased toward later training data to simulate the shift.

